Package: miadi-server
Version: 0.2.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: bash, miadi-config (>= 0.2.0), miadi-node (>= 24.21.0-1), miadi-node (<< 25)
Suggests: systemd, curl
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: The Miadi web app, built and ready to run
 The built Miadi web app (jgwill/Miadi), its launcher and a per-user systemd
 unit. It needs no source checkout, no pnpm and no build on the host: give it
 its settings with `miadi-server init <file>` and start it. It serves on
 127.0.0.1:3335 by default. `miadi-server --help` lists the commands and
 settings, and `miadi-server check` says what stops it from running.
 .
 It starts nothing when installed and is not part of miadi. A host that runs
 the app from its own checkout sets MIADI_PROJECT_DIR.
